data.bio_text:
PsychotroniK is a hybridization of "psychological" and "electronic". "Lab" represents our laboratory, where we play with electronic manipulation of the internal dimension of reality which affects the human experience. 

The word PsychotroniK furthermore, refers to the "Psychotronic Weapons" secretly tested in the 1960s by Russia and the USA. Through electromagnetic waves or low-frequency rays, they can influence brain cells, alter psychological states and make it possible to transmit conditioning and commands directly in the individual's thought process. They are used to transmit ultrasounds into the human brain, which perceives them but is unaware of them.
And if these ultrasounds were found in music, what would happen?

